  "title": "Buttery Gluten-Free Ranch Chex Mix",
  "description": "This snack mix makes a party-sized batch that you can store in the fridge for up to a week. This gluten-free combo is savory, buttery, salty, and a little tart from the cranberries.",
  "authors": [
    "Angela Sackett Superhotmama"
